### Experiments you should run

Run and document these as the core package:

* BERT vs BiLSTM vs CNN on NLI classification
* dense retrieval vs TF-IDF fallback
* top-k retrieval sensitivity
* reranking on/off
* robustness under typo/paraphrase/word-order noise
* latency comparison for each inference setup. 

### Metrics to show

For classification:

* accuracy
* macro F1
* per-class precision/recall/F1

For retrieval:

* Recall@k
* MRR
* latency

For system-level:

* end-to-end response time
* retrieval hit rate
* failure categories. 

